msgid "Guess I've always been cool. Just never knew it."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Anyway, I'm just gonna hang for a bit with my new pals."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter2/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You're welcome to join us!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter2/0/g-5/16
