#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/8
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "Yeah, why? What's wrong with us?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "These aren't good friends."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're gonna kill you."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I worry they might not be a good influence on you."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Sure they are!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "They've been hanging out with me while you've been off doing... whatever you do."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "Yeah. We've been keepin' Arma real good company."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-0/31 arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "<w>BEEEP</w> Oh shut up, silly beeper."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Kill me?! Never! They're just keeping me company!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "They've been here while you've been away."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "Yeah, you don't need that, Arma."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Whatever are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "We're just hangin' out!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "Nothin' wrong with that!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, but seriously Arma... You need to quit."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know better than this!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Oh, so you're gonna tell me how to live my life now?"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Do I,"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-0/c-4/12
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid "? Do I, really?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "You tell 'em, Arma!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Smokonio"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. That's it. Back the fuck off before you get smoked for real, ya little shits."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Smoking is responsible for over 7,000 fires a year."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Give them up for this sparkly smile?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about being a role model, Arma?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "We better go, you guys."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-5/18
msgctxt "Smokonio"
msgid "Somebody means business!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Smokalicious"
msgid "RUNNN!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Wait, are you serious?!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "But... you said you guys were harmless!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "We would never liiieeeeeee to youuuuuuu."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "But you just fucking did!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/39
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "What am I even doing!? Get outta here you little bastards!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/50
msgctxt "Smokonio"
msgid "Awwww noooo!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-6/58
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "OUT! NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You sure are... dazzling..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And wait a minute, didn't I read somewhere that cigarettes mess up your teeth?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "What? Mess up your what now? We'd never do that!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/31
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I did read that! You DO mess up teeth!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/39
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And a bunch of other stuff, too! Get out of here!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/50
msgctxt "Smokonio"
msgid "Aww man... You're no fun..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-7/58
msgctxt "Smokalicious"
msgid "Come on, guys. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "For who? There aren't even any other alarms in the house."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Jeez... What the hell was I thinking?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I definitely listened to some bad advice there."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Thank goodness you came around,"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaStopSmoking/0/g-2/29
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Think I need a minute to process this though. Come back and see me soon, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You know what? I'm gonna just keep hanging out with my new friends."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And there ain't a damn thing you can say to convince me otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/16
msgctxt "Ciggy"
msgid "Yeah! Jealous, much?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/24
msgctxt "Smokonio"
msgid "Now get outta here!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But Arma!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please, you gotta listen!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Come on back later, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaCantStopWontStop/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And when you do, bring your open mind with you."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Oh, hey there!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Thanks for helping me get away from those cigarettes."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "No idea what I was thinking! They were bad news."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/24
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "They were whispering some pretty strange stuff in my ear."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anytime, Arma!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were alarmingly relaxed about them."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What did you end up doing with them?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I needed a nudge!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "It was time to hit the panic button!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I gave them to Cam. He said he knew just what to do with them."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I think I was just... I don't know, bored!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "It can be tough being an emergency worker when there aren't any emergencies."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "It's easy to get hooked on the thrill!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And to feel empty when nothing's happening."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "But since putting down the Smokes, I started thinking... what about prevention?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Brilliant!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's always work to be done there."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I know! It's such a rich vein."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "On that note, I had this idea."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "So that we don't run into any more fires like that last one..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Why don't we investigate the source?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But we already know it was Sinclaire!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great idea, Arma!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I guess that's true."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "But I really think we should scratch below the surface."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Right? I wonder if he was working alone..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Do you know anyone who would be helpful in an investigation?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Unfortunately I can't think of anyone worth talking to..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/9/s/0 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about Maggie?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, there's Maggie... but she hates me."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Darn! Well if you think of someone, come on back!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-8/7 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Great idea!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/7 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Ooh... That's rough. Maybe some candy might help there!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/0/s/0 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know what that means?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/1/s/0 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want to..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/2/s/0 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm... good point."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/0 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A chill breeze announces Maggie's arrival before she even speaks. Seems she's still not forgiven you."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/8 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Even though we aren't the best of friends..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/19 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/19
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I can't pass up a good mystery."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/27 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/27
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Wow! Hi Maggie!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/35 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/35
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hello, Arma. We in the protection industry have to look out for each other..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/43 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/43
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Even if the human might not look out for us."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaPostFireEncounter3/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/51 arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-1/15/g-0/51
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "So!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Hey! Did you meet anyone to help with the investigation yet?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I did but she hates me..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dang. Still don't know anyone!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaMetMaggie/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "All good. It can wait!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie pops in at the merest suggestion of a case. You never officially summoned her, but it seems she just can't help herself."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well hello there, fellow sleuths!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm always up for a case!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We wanna know how the fire got started."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who do we blame for this mess!?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Of course! Let me see..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll help you round up suspects!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/maggiehatejoin/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "According to my brief perusal of the available evidence..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/maggiehatejoin/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The fire was started by a diabolical dalliance!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/maggiehatejoin/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No! Between who!?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/maggiehatejoin/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds hot."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/maggiehatejoin/c-3/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Too hot! Who were the culprits?!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, dear friends, the first suspect you already know."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It was Sinclaire! The 'mad' sink!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "...whom we will leave aside for the time being..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/g-0/24/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As he is the subject of an ongoing investigation."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/g-0/25/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As he could use a little time to rest after all he's been through."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireInvestigation/0/g-0/26/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
