#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're dead, Arma. They threw themselves into the fire."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Went up in smoke, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Huh. I could see that, actually."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "They did?!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "...that tracks, actually."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well, she's in the crawlspace. Let's check on her."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Arma. Are you ready to behave yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Arma, you can come out now. The Smokes are dead."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Heck no! I'd do it again in a heartbeat!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "No... but they were so—"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Eh, to be honest, I can see that happening."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They were YOLO types."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Couldn't have ended any other way, really."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I respect it. But I'm glad they're gone."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Alas. The beautiful always die young."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You know, now that I don't have those cigarettes whispering in my ear..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You feel normal again?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have another voice whispering in your ear?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Yeah... yeah I do."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Huh? No! I actually feel like myself again."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I feel like I should really get back to work."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "This has been a pretty crazy couple days."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Smoke alarm starts smoking and lighting fires? Normal."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... my brain needs a break."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Haha, yeah... how the heck did we end up here?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Mine too."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Anyway, I just want to thank you for sticking with me through all that."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I know I can be a handful sometimes, but at least you know I'm not boring!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Although I think I'll try to be a <i>bit</i> more boring after this."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No more fires, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you find any more cigarettes..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Jeez. Obviously!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Now that I'm off the smoke, I can't even imagine what I was thinking!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Leave them be, I know."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Well, I'm gonna go take a break. A real break, not a smoke break."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And... come see me again soon, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Maybe we can do something. Something normal!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like a date?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like generate some friction?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like get some ice cream at the Yummy Yeti?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "That would be amazing. I think we make a great pair."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Now that sounds like fun..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I might bring a bit of my wild side back for that."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "If you don't mind!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the kind of crazy I can get behind."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On second thought, maybe we just hang out as friends."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Or in front of, or on top of, or under..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I'm fine with that, too."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/c-1/15 arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Come see me soon!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I would love that!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "As friends? Or...?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As friends, Arma."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm talking about a date, Arma."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "That sounds perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Come see me again soon!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Despite it all, it's difficult to see Arma like this. She's so still and quiet."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Can't believe her battery's really out."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's better this way. She wasn't happy."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could just rez her with a new battery."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Let's at least let Wallace say goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He was always fond of her."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/26 arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall wall. Wall."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Walllllllll."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well said, Wallace."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Real tear jerker."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/g-0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "At times like these all I can do is wail."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/g-0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "To lose one of our own is a deep tragedy. For was she ever truly alive in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/g-0/6/b/1
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "A mystery for scholars greater than I to solve."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Even if it works..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I don't think she'll ever trust you again."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Worth a shot!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Better to leave her in peace."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/10
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "ZZZZzzzAP!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I'M ALIIIIIIIIVVVEEEEEE!!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/37
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "<w>BEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE</w>"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/48
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "<w>EEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE</w>"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/59
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "<w>EEEEEEEP!!!!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/70
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Can't believe that worked."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/78
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'll leave you two to catch up."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/89
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "What'd I miss?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We were... um... just being pals? And you were super normal?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Erm... I sorta had to off you. JUST FOR A BIT."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Oh! Ok! Sounds good!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I'll just get back to work doing my norm—"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "WAAAAIIIIT A MINUTE!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/39
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Why's the wall all black?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "New paint I was trying out?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never mind that! Look how well-slept you look!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't. Worry. About it."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Huh... I don't see the appeal, but ok."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Anyhow, I better get back to work."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-0/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "See you around, pal!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I guess I do look pretty vigorous."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Does that mean you're into me?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You bet your new battery it does."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah. Just being a polite pal."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "We might just have to go start a fire of our own."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "A totally non-literal one, of course!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/23/c-1/7 arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-2/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Well, I'll just go back to my business."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-1/23/c-1/15 arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-2/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Come and see me any time pal!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-0/47/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Sheesh! Ok, I get the point."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "YOU DID WHAT?!?!?!?!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/18
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You mean YOU did this!?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/26
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Ya know what, I was enjoying sleep mode."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/34
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "A whole lot more than I'm enjoying being employed in a house where I'm not wanted!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/42
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "SO LONG SUCKAAAA!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Arma reaches her arm over her shoulder, her hand fiddling with something between her shoulder blades. After a few moments her eyes grow glassy once more, and she slumps forward, quiet and cold."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/69
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Did she really just pull out her own battery?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/97/c-1/77
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Can't say I saw that coming."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Sad, but that might be best."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I guess all that's left is for you to say goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Until we meet again!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so sorry I failed you, Arma."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You left me with no choice."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/g-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There is nothing more to do here."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Hey! Always great to see you around!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You too, Arma! Wanna go do something?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You too! Wanna get Realized?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You bet! If you're down to help me study for my re-certification, we can hang out after!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_friend_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like a plan! I might learn a thing or two while I'm at it..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your day spent studying with your new friend Arma fills you with determination."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Well hello, my hero!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mmmm I like the way that sounds. But you're my hero, too!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're my hero - and want to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Do you want to go out on a date? It's always so good to spend time with you."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Hang on... do you feel that?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Feel what?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Is there a fire nearby or is it just how hot you are?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You might just be feeling the heat between us. Shall we put it out?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "There's nothing I'd enjoy more..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The fire between you intensifies... blazes... and is safely put out once more."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_hate_joiner/0/18/19
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "BEEP BEEP BEEP"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Holy smokes!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Do you have the proper certifications?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_join/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I've got them right here."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_join/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I need to study up."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_join/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Message received!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You're back. Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You know where to find me - hanging out on the Wallace."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Starting with the smoke alarm... hopefully that means we will be safe at least!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay Arma, let's see if you can save the day!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a smoke alarm, becomes..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Oh my goodness!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "So this is what the ground feels like..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "It feels so good to finally be able to move around!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Now I can really respond to an emergency!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Instead of, you know, just beeping a lot."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I liked your beeps, though..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, this is much better."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "No you didn't."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, no I didn't."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gimme one for old times' sake."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "AAAAAAAAAAAAUUUUGHHHHH!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/23/c-1/26
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Hm...."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/c-0/23/c-1/34
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Doesn't have quite the same ring to it."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I've spent so much time stuck up here on the wall - I feel like I need to get out there and move my legs."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Oh! Is there a good hiking trail around here?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, there's a nice short one nearby."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a good medium-sized one."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a longish one I like."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Nah... I'm thinking one in the thousand-plus mile range."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "There's some stuff I need to work out."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I feel like my character arc was BIG."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so proud of you. Go forth!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_realized/0/g-1/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Before you go... there's a fire I need you to put out."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I know those eyes."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/19
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Is the fire... in your pants?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know it."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... I totally misread the situation. I'm bad at this."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Let's extinguish that together."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without changing out of her firefighter's apparel, Arma promptly lifts you and carries you over her shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Let's go find a hose..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just make sure the water's warm."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tie me up, mommy."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna be in charge this time..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Just shy of hot..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "My duty is your protection."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Fighting fire with fire, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Arma's love is tactical, alert, and always smoking hot."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/g-0/11
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "STOP DROP AND ROLLLLL!!!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/g-0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Before you know it, Arma has put out your flames not once, not twice, but three times."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-0/31/g-0/30
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Whew! Okay hero, my job is done."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Haha! No worries."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Arma went on to complete the through-hike triple crown: Appalachian Trail, Pacific Crest Trail, and Continental Divide... all in one year."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "By the time she was finished, the fires raging in her own psyche had finally calmed down, leaving her in peace at last."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When deciding what to do next, she thought back to when she was happiest - overlooking a grand vista, and thinking on its protection."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As chance would have it, she was offered a job by the Forest Service: one that she was all too happy to accept."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_join/32
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Firewatch Deputy Arma, reporting in. All clear."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/arma_love_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "From her tall tower, she was reminded of her days as a sentinel high up in your own home. Happy at last."
msgstr ""
